  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scale-up of Anti-Malaria Program in Chad - Chad (01-Jan-2016-30-Jun-2018)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chad, Malaria, United Nations Development Programme (UNDP Chad)This program has the following goals: Help improve the state of health of the country&#x2019;s population by reducing the human and socio-economic impact of malaria. The objectives of this program are: Cut malaria-related morbidity by 30 percent compared with its 2013 level by the end of 2016, and reduce it by a further 20 percent between 2017 and 2018..  Successfully complete 80 percent of the malaria control support interventions by the end of 2018.</narrative>
  </description>
